<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc was not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said McDermott International Inc, J. Ray McDermott, McDermott Inc and, as well as Corimon SACA were also unavailable.</p>
</text>
